{"_id":"68a736128ec3d8323af1489d","roadmapSlug":"data-analyst","nodeId":"2DDJUFr0AJTVR2Whj8zub","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:58.099Z","description":"# Pivot Tables\n\nPivot tables are one of Excel's most powerful features for summarizing and analyzing large datasets. They allow data to be grouped, filtered, and aggregated across multiple dimensions without writing formulas. Pivot tables are used to quickly explore data and build summary reports by dragging and dropping fields.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"Create a Pivot Table","url":"https://support.microsoft.com/en-gb/office/create-a-pivottable-to-analyze-worksheet-data-a9a84538-bfe9-40a9-a8e9-f99134456576","_id":"6a7f4a4fcb44947debcf59f3"},{"type":"article","title":"Pivot Tables in Excel","url":"https://www.excel-easy.com/data-analysis/pivot-tables.html","_id":"6a7f4a4fcb44947debcf59f4"},{"type":"video","title":"How to Create a Pivot Table in Excel","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PdJzy956wo4","_id":"6a7f4a4fcb44947debcf59f5"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:03:11.488Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a8894ecaca636c6b9e973f1","title":"DataCamp - Associate Data Analyst in SQL","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/1GK1qD"},{"_id":"6a5e04dcfb5fcb94d041675b","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/AgYmJK"},{"_id":"6a5e189a077863512aba4c73","title":"roadmap.sh - Master SQL","partner":"roadmap.sh","type":"course","url":"https://roadmap.sh/courses/sql"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/data-analyst/content/2DDJUFr0AJTVR2Whj8zub.md"}